1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Give an agent authority. Let it pass some of that authority to another agent.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Then let that one pass it on.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,000
At what point does permission become a blank cheque?

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
INTENTRA puts a limit on that chain.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
The owner starts with one NEAR.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Agent A receives it — one NEAR of authority, capped at the original grant.

7
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:28,000
Every allocation that follows must fit inside this boundary.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Agent A delegates zero point four NEAR to B.

9
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Now B tries something different: zero point eight for C.

10
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,000
No. B only inherited zero point four.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,500
The contract rejects the expansion.

12
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,500
ATTENUATION.

13
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,500
Then A tries to allocate another zero point seven NEAR.

14
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,500
But zero point four is already reserved for B.

15
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
That would make one point one against an original grant of one.

16
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:04,000
Rejected. BUDGET_RESERVATION.

17
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,500
Zero point four plus zero point seven equals one point one zero.

18
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,500
The original limit is one point zero zero.

19
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,000
The aggregate stays inside the boundary — always.

20
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,500
Now watch the valid path.

21
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,500
B delegates zero point one five NEAR to C.

22
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:21,500
C stays within that boundary and successfully transfers zero point one NEAR.

23
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,500
The transfer settles.

24
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,500
Here's the testnet evidence.

25
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:28,000
This is not simulated.

26
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Recorded on NEAR testnet, verifiable on-chain.

27
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,500
But the owner still has control.

28
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,500
The original grant is revoked.

29
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:49,500
B tries to act. REVOKED.

30
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,500
C tries too. REVOKED.

31
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,500
The descendants cannot keep using authority that no longer exists.

32
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:59,000
One action at the root. The entire chain is invalidated.

33
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Deployed on NEAR testnet.

34
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:12,500
Twenty-four contract tests.

35
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Twenty-three JSON-RPC checks.

36
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:17,500
Nine live SDK checks.

37
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:20,500
Agents can delegate authority.

38
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:23,000
They cannot enlarge it.

39
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:25,000
INTENTRA.
